<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Application Approved</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; padding: 12px 24px; background: #16a34a; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Your application was approved 🎉</h2>
      <p>Hi <%= name %>, the owner approved your application for the room "<%= roomName %>".</p>
      <p>Pay the booking deposit to lock the room before someone else does. Your lease starts once the deposit is confirmed.</p>
      <div class="footer">&copy; Housing & Roommate Management Platform. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
